:: Felix Playground Soccer Pants Down [nobr]

You ask <span class="char-name">Felix</span> if you can join his game of soccer, to which he gladly agrees. <span class="dialogue-text">“Of course! Our team is down a member, so join in! Though, I’m worth at least 3 players, so it may be a little unfair.”</span> <span class="char-name">Felix</span> smirks, his cute pretend ‘over-optimism’ shining through. <span class="green-text">You nod in agreement, telling <span class="char-name">Felix</span> you’ll show him who’s worth 3 players!</span><br>

<<set _ad to [
    {
