            <span class="pink-text">You stop in your tracks, nearly tumbling over, as you quickly reach down and yank up your $PlayerBottoms.Type, the laughter echoing in your ears. Both the enemy goalie and half the opposing team are on the ground laughing so hard they’re crying. Both your embarrassment and the extreme anticlimactic-ness of it all is too much for them.</span><br>
            <br>

            <span class="char-name">Felix</span>, ever focusing on the game, takes this chance to collect the discarded ball and score a shot that wins your team the game! Your team cheers, crediting your amazing ‘distraction’ for the victory, a few boys even asking you to <span class="dialogue-text">“Show them how to do that trick!”</span> <span class="pink-text">It was all playful teasing though, despite how embarrassed you feel.</span><br>

